ev/search?q=uuid:db84d8f9-7c92-45e2-9ec7-397a880d62a9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:db84d8f9-7c92-45e2-9ec7-397a880d62a9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The barracks in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>List of missing goods:\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Ring (Red stone embedded - Debin thinks it could be carnelian)\n</p><p>Magic dagger\n</p><p>Music box\n</p><p>Scroll of Tasha's Hideous Laughter\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>One missing item? A fluke. Two? A concern. Three? Flagrant thievery. See something amiss? Report to me at once.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- Bakshi\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715163121\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1597/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27158/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6101/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932028/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.148      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.148      1 -total\n 57.28%   23.568      7 Template:Icon_text\n 51.21%   21.074     17 Template:Trim\n 23.85%    9.814      2 Template:Uid\n 14.93%    6.142